sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant U as Program (user)
    participant V as Program (vital code)
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Inside TrackController.scan (UC-09).
    W->>U: scan(image)
    U-->>W: return SIG_s_R, _Y, _G, _SG
    W->>V: scan(image + SIG_s_*, OCC_b, CLOSED_b)
    V->>V: scan internal: V_OK_s := exactly one aspect, the block clear and open
    alt V_OK_s
        V->>V: scan internal: OUT_ aspect bits := the program's
    else not
        V->>V: scan internal: OUT_SIG_s_R := 1, the others 0
    end
    V->>V: scan internal: OUT_HALF_b := OUT_SIG_s_Y
    V-->>W: return OUT_SIG_s_*, OUT_HALF_b
    W->>W: encode_outputs internal: aspects[s] := the one lit aspect
    W-->>M: read aspects
    M->>M: _outputs internal: keyed by BlockKey, _aspect_to_wire(aspect)
    M-->>H: return TrackModelOutputs.signal_commands
    H->>H: _finish_tick internal: next tick, inputs_for(): track_controller_to_track_model(...)
    H->>TM: STEP: signal aspect
